        "make-peace :parameters (?peacemaker - creature ?creature - creature ?position - (either place location)) :precondition (and (alive ?peacemaker) (not (stunned ?peacemaker)) (at ?peacemaker ?position) (alive ?creature) (at ?creature ?position) (not (fighting ?peacemaker ?creature)) (not (fighting ?creature ?peacemaker))) :effect (and (friends ?peacemaker ?creature) (friends ?creature ?peacemaker)))": "(:action make-peace :parameters (?peacemaker - creature ?creature - creature ?position - (either place location)) :precondition (and (alive ?peacemaker) (not (stunned ?peacemaker)) (at ?peacemaker ?position) (alive ?creature) (at ?creature ?position) (not (fighting ?peacemaker ?creature)) (not (fighting ?creature ?peacemaker))) :effect (and (friends ?peacemaker ?creature) (friends ?creature ?peacemaker)))",
        "begin-erupt": "(:action begin-erupt\n :parameters (?source - landform)\n :precondition (and)\n :effect (and (erupting ?source) (forall (?entity - creature) (when (at ?entity ?source) (and (not (safe ?entity))))))\n)",
